{"availability":"available","full":"evoluteur/harmonograph-maker","name":"harmonograph-maker","description":"Harmonograph and Lissajous figures: musical intervals drawn by pendulums, with phase, detune, damping and a rotary pendulum, a drawing animation, stereo sound, and SVG or PNG export.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-23T03:14:01Z","updated":"2026-10-10T08:02:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://evoluteur.github.io/harmonograph-maker/","topics":["esoterica","generative-art-toolkit","harmonograph","harmony","javascript","lissajous","lissajous-curve","lissajous-figures","lissajous-figures-generator","pendulum","pendulum-simulation","physics-simulation","printable","pythagoras","sacred-geometry","sound","svg","svg-generator","web-audio-api","webaudio"],"demo":"https://evoluteur.github.io/mandala-maker/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T21:01:03.090Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T21:01:03.090Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T21:01:03.090Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:50:53.885Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:32.994Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T11:14:44.102Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:18:30.718Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T13:34:54.951Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T21:01:03.090Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A harmonograph draws with pendulums: one swings the pen from side to side, another up and down. When their speeds are in a simple ratio, the same ratios that sound consonant in music, the drawing closes on itself in a simple, regular figure."],"features":["Interval: harmonograph or Lissajous, ten musical intervals (unison, octave, fifth, fourth, major and minor thirds, major and minor sixths, whole tone, twelfth), or any ratio from 1 to 12 for each pendulum.","Pendulums: phase, detune (a small mismatch that makes the figure turn), and for the harmonograph damping, a rotary pendulum with its speed, and the swing time. Surprise me picks random settings.","Watch and listen: Draw it traces the figure the way the pen would, Turn the phase animates it, and Listen plays the two pendulums as two tones, one in each ear, at the same ratio.","Look and save: five color schemes (ink on paper, gold, neon, spectrum, blueprint), line width, Download PNG (2400 pixels square) or Download SVG."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evoluteur/harmonograph-maker/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bc4cbe9503c70aef342d6e49abae6986957384dde7f62c024799beed9b7d374b","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:53.966Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:21:58.826Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A harmonograph draws with pendulums: one swings the pen from side to side, another up and down. When their speeds are in a simple ratio, the same ratios that sound consonant in music, the drawing closes on itself in a simple, regular figure.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evoluteur/harmonograph-maker/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"bc4cbe9503c70aef342d6e49abae6986957384dde7f62c024799beed9b7d374b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evoluteur/harmonograph-maker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T13:21:58.826Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T01:32:20Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/evoluteur/harmonograph-maker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T13:21:58.827Z","hash":"bc4cbe9503c70aef342d6e49abae6986957384dde7f62c024799beed9b7d374b","originalBytes":3265,"storedBytes":3265,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:53.885Z","qualityPriority":false,"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:42.002Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://evoluteur.github.io/mandala-maker/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:42.002Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:42.002Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-19T14:06:42.002Z","target":"